verification v_a89f9e319fcd0014 expectation=e_b1c5dd37a9811667 status=passed method="cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; docker compose config" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The server-feature test suite and warnings-denied Clippy pass, and Docker Compose renders a valid API/PostgreSQL stack. Repository mutation and PR synchronization are intentionally not part of this foundation slice.";
verification v_3906f4ba42c1bcf6 expectation=e_b1c5dd37a9811667 status=passed supersedes=v_a89f9e319fcd0014 method="cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; cargo run --locked -- review; docker compose smoke test" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The server foundation, scanner regression test, warnings-denied Clippy, review packet, and disposable Docker/PostgreSQL health plus login smoke test all pass. Review returns 0 critical and 0 attention findings; remaining warnings are maintainability and explicitly inconclusive design-stage expectations.";
verification v_5f91c0de7a3b2e44 expectation=e_4f2d7a8c1b6e90d3 status=passed method="cargo test --locked; cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; docker build; disposable Docker Compose repository endpoint smoke test" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Repository validation tests pass, the migration builds into the server image, and the disposable Compose smoke test authenticated as the bootstrapped administrator, registered one GitHub repository, and observed two idle sync states keyed by its two configured base branches. The test did not contact GitHub or create a pull request.";
verification v_2a7d9c4e1f6b3085 expectation=e_7b1e4c9d2a6f83e0 status=passed method="cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; docker build; disposable Docker Compose PostgreSQL sync-state and audit smoke test; CSRF cookie/header smoke test" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The sync endpoint queues only configured repository/base-branch pairs, preserves four independent persisted states across two repositories, remains idempotent for repeated requests, and records one audit event per accepted request. The CSRF unit test rejects mismatched tokens, and the live smoke test confirmed the issued cookie/header pair authorizes mutation. Unknown branches are rejected; GitHub and pull-request mutation remain unimplemented.";
verification v_6c1e8a4d9f2b3075 expectation=e_3d8a1f6c4b9e20d7 status=passed method="cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; docker compose config" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Server-feature tests cover the provider boundary, JWT input validation, installation-id validation, and configuration shape; warnings-denied Clippy passes; and Compose exposes only optional server-side configuration variables. The API can validate an installation and report expiry without returning the token. Webhooks, repository reads/writes, and pull-request synchronization remain unimplemented.";
verification v_1e7c4a9d2b6f3085 expectation=e_8c2f5a1d7b9e40f6 status=passed method="cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The provider inspection path uses configured repository metadata and allowlisted branches, encodes branch path segments, and returns only a branch SHA. Unit coverage validates safe path construction and invalid provider inputs; arbitrary repository paths and branches are not accepted by the handler.";
verification v_3f7a1c9e2b6d3085 expectation=e_6d2f8a1c9b4e3075 status=inconclusive method="cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; architecture review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The worker, bounded authenticated materialization request, allowlisted sidecar guard, atomic claim transitions, active-PR reuse path, and migration invariant are implemented and compile cleanly. A live PostgreSQL/GitHub integration run is still required to verify provider responses, migration behavior on deployed data, and merged-event reset handling.";
verification v_4e8a1c6d2f9b3075 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; static frontend security and feature review; docker compose configuration review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The frontend is same-origin behind Nginx, sends cookie sessions with the CSRF header for mutations, renders only currently implemented API capabilities, escapes API-derived text before insertion, keeps GitHub credentials out of the bundle, and provides responsive business/engineering repository and synchronization workflows. Threaded review, timeline, and compliance conclusions are not fabricated.";
verification v_5a9e3c1d7b2f4086 expectation=e_b1c5dd37a9811667 status=passed method="git check-ignore -v .env; node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose config with in-process local variables" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Real .env files are ignored while .env.example remains trackable, the frontend client parses successfully, and Compose resolves the documented local deployment variables without requiring secrets in the repository.";
verification v_6b1d4f8c2a7e5096 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="docker compose config; docker compose build frontend from canonical workspace" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Compose resolves the frontend root build context and Dockerfile.frontend, and Docker successfully builds the Nginx frontend image. The separate Projects path is a Windows junction that Docker Desktop cannot traverse reliably.";
verification v_7c2e5a1d9b4f6087 expectation=e_b1c5dd37a9811667 status=passed method="docker compose config; docker compose build api frontend" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The API and frontend images build successfully, Compose renders the service_healthy dependency, and the API runtime contains the curl healthcheck client. A short admin password remains correctly rejected before the API starts.";
verification v_8d3a7c1e5b9f6042 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="docker compose config; docker compose build frontend; POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login; browser reload" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The Caddy frontend image builds, the live same-origin login POST returns HTTP 200 through port 3000, and the reloaded login page keeps Sign out hidden until authentication succeeds.";
verification v_9e4b8c2a6d1f5073 expectation=e_b1c5dd37a9811667 status=passed method="cargo test --locked; cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked -- -D warnings; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Default and server-enabled tests pass, and both Clippy configurations pass with warnings denied. One transient OneDrive target-directory lock required isolated disposable build directories.";
verification v_1f5a9c3d7b2e6048 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; static frontend state review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The frontend initializes signed out, explicitly hides session controls on the login view, and only reveals identity and sign-out after authenticated session discovery.";
verification v_2a6c9e1d5f3b7048 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend; frontend copy and accessibility review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The frontend image builds, action icons are centered inline SVG controls with accessible labels, rail content shares a left edge, and the workspace header explains portable .susu evidence and its shared surfaces.";
verification v_3b7d1f5a9c2e6048 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="docker compose build frontend; frontend spacing review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The frontend image builds with a 12px top inset above the empty repository list, preserving alignment while giving the heading and empty state clearer separation.";
verification v_4c8e2a6d1f5b7093 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend; responsive CSS review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The desktop evidence note is capped at 280px and inset 32px from the shell edge, while the mobile breakpoint removes the inset and permits natural wrapping.";
verification v_5d9f3b1a7c2e6048 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build api frontend; live authenticated browser review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The empty authenticated workspace presents the three-step onboarding wizard, explains each step in the Susumu visual language, keeps skip reversible, and shows the deployment capability state before requesting any credential input.";
verification v_6e1a4c8d2f7b5093 expectation=e_3d8a1f6c4b9e20d7 status=passed method="cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; docker compose build api; live /healthz check" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Encrypted credential round-trip tests pass, the server build and Clippy pass, migration 0004 applies in Docker, and the live health endpoint reports credential encryption and GitHub configuration separately without exposing key material.";
verification v_7f2b5d9a1c6e4083 expectation=e_8975f30ee4865f18 status=passed method="cargo test --locked --features server; GitHub discovery API review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The administrator-only discovery route obtains installation tokens server-side, lists installed repositories, and returns bounded repository metadata through the shared API shape.";
verification v_8a6c2e1d5f9b7043 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend; onboarding accessibility review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Step one now includes an accessible info button and expandable guide covering private App creation, installation scope, required repository permissions, and encrypted server-side key handling.";
verification v_9b7d3f1a5c2e6048 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend; async form submission review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="GitHub App setup and manual repository setup retain stable form references across awaited API calls, allowing reset and follow-up loading to complete without a null currentTarget error.";
verification v_ac8e2d4f6b1a5073 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="docker compose build frontend; responsive CSS review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The onboarding message and form no longer use narrow max-width caps, allowing the GitHub App setup copy, inputs, and private key field to fill the desktop card while retaining responsive behavior.";
verification v_bd9f3e1a7c2e6048 expectation=e_8975f30ee4865f18 status=passed method="cargo test --locked --features server; node --check frontend/app.js; repository inspection boundary review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The authenticated project inspection endpoint reads only configured sidecar paths through the server-side GitHub installation token, and the frontend presents present record areas while loading their content into the scoped synchronization editor.";
verification v_ce1a5d7f3b9e6048 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend; live browser review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The live workspace uses one Project memory card, hides raw sidecar content, and presents readable purpose-based authored record cards without making source or records appear directly editable.";
verification v_df2b6a8e4c1f5079 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend; responsive spacing review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The evidence-area buttons now have a visible bottom margin before purpose-based record cards, preserving the single-card hierarchy on desktop and mobile layouts.";
verification v_e7c1a9d5b3f60482 expectation=e_6f3a9c1d7b5e2048 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend; structured form review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The authenticated workspace now presents guided forms for four authored record types, generates portable records without exposing raw syntax, and submits only configured sidecar changes through the existing synchronization endpoint.";
verification v_f8d2b6a4c1e50793 expectation=e_7a4c1e9d5b2f3086 status=passed method="cargo test --locked; node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend; portal detail review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Sessions now use a durable browser cookie and database expiry, the portal restores the workspace through /api/me, evidence records support fuzzy search and detail navigation, and the detail view labels timeline provenance and missing source locations without inventing timestamps or code.";
verification v_a9e3c7b1d5f60482 expectation=e_8b5d2f1a7c9e4063 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; startup error-path review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The frontend now signs out only when /api/me rejects the session; failures after authentication remain in the workspace and display a repository-loading error.";
verification v_b0f4d8a2c6e91573 expectation=e_8b5d2f1a7c9e4063 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend; workspace bootstrap review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Authoring tabs now bind through document.querySelectorAll, removing the rendering exception that prevented the authenticated project memory workspace from loading.";
verification v_c1a5e9d3b7f60482 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend; responsive control review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Dropdowns use the Susumu control treatment, Project memory receives a stable clipped edge treatment, record filtering is labeled and updated on input, and the unnecessary save-location note is removed.";
verification v_d2b6a8e4c1f50793 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend; recommendation and timeline review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Next work now appears above Project memory with actionable recommendations, search reports live result counts, and the record timeline uses a continuous vertical connector with aligned markers.";
verification v_e8f4b2c1d6a9e3075 expectation=e_4f8b2c1d6a9e3075 status=passed method="cargo test --locked; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked -- -D warnings; node --check frontend/app.js; anchored thread UI review" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="Portable review anchors parse and round-trip, CLI and TUI retain anchor and parent context, and live record details show nested threads with reply and new-thread actions that use repository-scoped synchronization.";
verification v_f9a5c3e7b1d60482 expectation=e_5a9c3f7b1d60482 status=passed method="cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; node --check frontend/app.js; docker compose build frontend" source="human:maintainer" evidence=- basis=- detail="The server materializes parsed record summaries into indexed Postgres rows, exposes project and branch-scoped ranked fuzzy search with filters and pagination, updates changed sidecars after synchronization, refreshes repository branches periodically, and the portal debounces API searches with a local fallback.";
verification v_8d4f1a6c2b90735e expectation=e_6b2d8f4a1c90735e status=inconclusive method="cargo test, clippy, Docker smoke test" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="The implementation and validation are in progress; GitHub conflict behavior requires an integration repository test.";
verification v_a6c3e9f1b20748d5 expectation=e_6b2d8f4a1c90735e status=passed method="cargo test --locked --features server local_github_update_branch_scenario" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="A local GitHub-compatible HTTP fixture accepts an expected-head update and separately returns HTTP 422; both outcomes preserve the expected conflict semantics.";
verification v_c8e5a2f7d104936b expectation=e_6b2d8f4a1c90735e status=passed method="docker compose fixture stack and portal walkthrough" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="The Docker fixture seeds local-fixture/susumu-demo in conflict state, the portal shows PR #7 and the base SHA transition, and repository evidence loads through the fake provider without the duplicate-key scan error.";
verification v_d9f6b3a1e2c74850 expectation=e_6b2d8f4a1c90735e status=passed method="cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; node --check frontend/app.js; Docker fixture resolver walkthrough" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="Conflict merge tests prove distinct records from both sides are retained and same-ID changes require an explicit choice. The authenticated portal walkthrough displayed the structured resolver and submitted both fixture records into the active pull request while leaving the base branch unchanged.";
verification v_e1a7c4d2b9f60853 expectation=e_6b2d8f4a1c90735e status=passed method="cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; node --check frontend/app.js; Docker fixture conflict-state review" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="The server conflict gate preserves the conflicted state and returns a conflict response before new synchronization work can be queued. The frontend disables structured authoring and Open Work while conflict is present, clears stale repository data on connection changes, and ignores late inspection responses from another repository.";
verification v_f2b8d4e1a7c60954 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="cargo fmt --all; cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; node --check frontend/app.js; Docker frontend and portal review" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="Provider scan failures now present actionable GitHub connection guidance instead of a generic internal server error. The portal conflict review explains automatic record inclusion, uses a stacked action layout, and keeps Project memory spacing aligned with the branded card system.";
verification v_c7e2a1f9b4d60835 expectation=e_4f2d7a8c1b6e90d3 status=passed method="cargo fmt --all; cargo test --locked; cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked -- -D warnings; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; node --check frontend/app.js; git diff --check" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="The portal's Connect a repository dialog discovers repositories from the existing server-side GitHub App connection, hides raw owner and installation fields, filters already-connected repositories, and relies on the server's complete default sidecar set. The opt-in Docker conflict fixture and its deployment instructions were removed.";
verification v_d8f3a2b1c7e60495 expectation=e_4f2d7a8c1b6e90d3 status=passed method="cargo fmt --all; cargo test --locked; cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked -- -D warnings; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; node --check frontend/app.js; Docker migration and health check" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="A fresh multi-connection migration preserved the existing GitHub App and linked the configured repository. The running Docker API and frontend are healthy, and the portal now supports adding or reusing connections and selecting an existing repository branch.";
verification v_e9a4b3c2d8f60716 expectation=e_9a4c1e7d2b6f3085 status=passed method="node --check frontend/app.js; cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; Docker frontend rebuild" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="Connection dialog cancellation no longer invokes the API, and the Project memory card uses the shared card border, background, clipping, and shadow styles. API, frontend, and Postgres containers remain healthy.";
verification v_f1a2c3d4e5b60718 expectation=e_88f8b90833f3a00c status=passed method="git diff --check; cargo fmt --all; cargo test --locked; cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked -- -D warnings; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; cargo run --locked -- review --work work.susu; cargo run --locked -- readiness" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="Documentation was checked against current routes, frontend flows, synchronization behavior, feature inventory, and existing evidence and compliance vocabulary.";
verification v_7c3d9a1f5b2e4087 expectation=e_7c3d9a1f5b2e4087 status=passed method="git diff --check; cargo run --locked -- review --work work.susu; cargo run --locked -- readiness" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="The README and deployment guide now document local Compose testing and production deployment responsibilities without assuming PowerShell, while retaining the existing security, persistence, and GitHub setup boundaries.";
verification v_3e9a1c7d5b2f4086 expectation=e_88f8b90833f3a00c status=passed method="Markdown local-link check; Markdown fence check; git diff --check; cargo test --locked; cargo test --locked --features server; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked -- -D warnings; cargo clippy --all-targets --locked --features server -- -D warnings; cargo run --locked -- review --work work.susu; cargo run --locked -- readiness" source="human:owner" evidence=- basis=- detail="The documentation set was checked for resolving local links, balanced code fences, platform-neutral onboarding, current live and static capability boundaries, and successful project validation.";
